sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Customer
    participant S as Storefront
    participant O as Order service
    participant P as Payment provider
    C->>S: Place order
    S->>O: createOrder()
    O->>P: authorize(amount)
    P-->>O: authorized
    O->>O: reserve stock
    O-->>S: order confirmed
    S-->>C: Confirmation page
    P-)O: webhook: captured
